3348 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I believe the best problems to solve sit at the intersection of desirability\054 feasibility\054 and viability \024 solving the right problem before solving the problem right\056 That means working as a triad with engineering and product\054 staying closely connected to customers through research \050moderated calls\054 usability testing\051 and building relationships across Customer Success\054 Support\054 GTM\054 and Marketing to understand where design can have the most impact\056\nWithin SafetyCulture\047s Analytics domain\054 I led data visualisation work \024 modernising how customers create\054 visualise\054 and act on their data \024 and was part of the team behind the platform\047s earliest AI investigation\054 validating real world usage alongside customer appetite\056\n13 years of design experience \050spanning brand\054 advertising\054 and product\051 underpins all of this\054 sharpened by a UX\057UI Design course through General Assembly Sydney in 2018\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 3349 0 R
     /Pg 3314 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
