3392 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Key points\nProblem\072 only \17645\045 of users who started building a chart actually finished it \050Nov 2024\023Mar 2025\051 \024 \042the learning curve\042 came up repeatedly in customer calls\056\nApproach\072 a natural\055language chat interface that generates a chart instantly\054 then asks guided follow\055up questions \050metric \222 attribute \222 filters \222 chart type \222 config\051 only when needed\056\nScope\072 deliberately limited v1 to one entry point \050the Analytics landing page\051 \024 excluded dashboard\055level chart creation to avoid filter\055consistency issues and match design capacity\056\nSuccess metrics defined\072 lift completion rate past the 45\045 baseline\073 track \045 of charts created via natural language as the adoption signal\056\nStatus\072 design and spec reached launch\055readiness planning \050dogfood \222 beta \222 GA\051 before the roadmap shifted\056)
     /K [ 39 ]
     /P 3393 0 R
     /Pg 3314 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
